WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.389
s'iz KASETA numer dray. zayt azoy gut, dertseylt mir vayter ale ayer-

00:00:02.087 --> 00:00:02.961
⟨oy⟩

00:00:07.065 --> 00:00:08.358
iberlebenishn.

00:00:07.082 --> 00:00:13.050
iz shoyn. vos kon ikh aykh nokh ⟨farts- UNK kh'hob kh'hob tsu dertseyln ober kh'kon nisht UNK dertseyln⟩.

00:00:13.157 --> 00:00:16.452
iz vi az-, dertseylt a bisl vi hot zikh gelebt in Daytshland?

00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:17.727
in Daytshland

00:00:16.452 --> 00:00:19.884
⟨vi⟩ hobn zey nisht gevust az ir zent a yidishe. vi hot ir zikh an eytse getun?

00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:19.670
neyn, ⟨zi hot⟩ nisht gevust.

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.189
zi hot nisht gevust s'iz ⟨dort iz⟩ geven a

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:25.604
dem zelbn, bay der er hot gehat di zelbe d- d-

00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:29.050
s'iz azoy gevezn. der vos ⟨s'iz⟩ gekumen mikh nemen

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:31.258
iz nisht gevezn der balebos.

00:00:31.618 --> 00:00:37.547
fun dem, fun di, f- s'i-

00:00:37.547 --> 00:00:39.227
fun di GOSPODYNIA

00:00:39.232 --> 00:00:43.579
vos zi hot mikh genumen, er iz gevezn oykhet a ongeshtelter.

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:45.719
er iz geven vos hot gefirt

00:00:45.777 --> 00:00:49.233
di di s- di vertshaft dort aza

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:52.919
a vi hot er, a RZOŃCA, vi me hot gezogt bay undz, ir veyst.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:54.950
yo, a MANAGER aza

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.691
vos hot gefirt ⟨d-⟩

00:00:54.691 --> 00:00:55.670
a MANAGER.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:59.619
vayl azoy, di froy gehat, di daytshke hot gehat tsvey zin

00:00:59.619 --> 00:01:02.033
un beyde zenen geven bay militer.

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:04.378
un zi hot gehat a groyse GOSPODARKA

00:01:04.378 --> 00:01:06.138
iz ir gekumen

00:01:06.246 --> 00:01:08.940
tsu haltn a mentsh, afile tsvey.

00:01:09.098 --> 00:01:11.406
hot zi gehaltn a sheygets

00:01:11.406 --> 00:01:13.091
un zi hot mikh genumen.

00:01:13.131 --> 00:01:15.075
iz ikh bin geven in di shtub

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:20.371
ober ikh hob ⟨gemolkn⟩ di ki, gelakht mit sheygets, ⟨bin⟩ ikh geganen fun feld arbetn

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:22.018
azoy gut vi di sheygets.

00:01:22.817 --> 00:01:24.802
ikh hob gearbet ⟨ikh bin⟩

00:01:23.425 --> 00:01:26.524
der sheygets es iz geven a daytsh oder a folksdaytsh?

00:01:25.838 --> 00:01:26.931
ah neyn

00:01:26.931 --> 00:01:29.949
a g- a nisht a p- a a katolik

00:01:28.437 --> 00:01:29.511
a daytsh?

00:01:29.854 --> 00:01:30.742
a daytsh?

00:01:30.242 --> 00:01:32.316
neyn neyn neyn neyn

00:01:31.356 --> 00:01:32.704
a ⟨poyer⟩, a ⟨poyer⟩

00:01:32.316 --> 00:01:34.972
a poylishe fun Poyln, yo, di ale poylishe.

00:01:33.008 --> 00:01:34.046
a ⟨poylish⟩

00:01:34.972 --> 00:01:37.866
di ale poylishe hot men dokh genumen tsu di arbet.

00:01:36.978 --> 00:01:37.987
 yo

00:01:37.866 --> 00:01:39.604
iz ah er hot gearbet

00:01:39.604 --> 00:01:41.354
in in in feld

00:01:41.354 --> 00:01:43.466
un er hot gearbet in shtal.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.740
zi hot gehat etlekhe beheymes, etlekhe ki.

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:50.733
un ikh hob gearbet oykh in g- geholfn ⟨melkn⟩ di ki.

00:01:50.733 --> 00:01:54.316
un in a, gevashn, un gekokht, un geroymt.

00:01:54.316 --> 00:01:55.802
ales vos me hot gedarft.

00:01:57.023 --> 00:01:58.316
azoy vi

00:01:59.402 --> 00:02:01.539
vi der der

00:02:01.697 --> 00:02:05.466
sheygets vider fun di andere GOSPODYNIA

00:02:05.466 --> 00:02:08.123
hot hot hot zi hot gevolt hobn

00:02:08.123 --> 00:02:11.630
oykhet ⟨nokh⟩ a mentshn, nokh a a a froy in di shtub arayn.

00:02:11.788 --> 00:02:14.009
hot zi, iz zi gekumen

00:02:14.337 --> 00:02:16.659
yo, hot er gezogt,

00:02:17.307 --> 00:02:20.003
der sheygets vos hot dort gedint oykhet,

00:02:20.003 --> 00:02:22.222
zogt er "ikh vel fregn mayn,

00:02:22.222 --> 00:02:26.008
mayn ⟨dinge⟩, vos me hot yetst gebrengt, efsher veyst zi fun aza

00:02:26.031 --> 00:02:26.981
eyne".

00:02:26.981 --> 00:02:28.247
zog ikh

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.294
"yo, mayne a tokhter".

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.022
di tokhter iz alt geven draytsn yor,

00:02:33.022 --> 00:02:35.846
kh'meyn s'iz azoy ⟨efsher hot⟩ gehat draytsn, ⟨ober⟩ tsvelf yor.

00:02:36.763 --> 00:02:38.984
dos iz geven di blondinke?

00:02:38.139 --> 00:02:39.860
dos iz geven di blonde, yo.

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:44.472
hot zi, hob ikh gezogt "ikh hob a tokhter

00:02:44.472 --> 00:02:47.237
un zol er shikn, brengen di tokhter".

00:02:48.677 --> 00:02:51.502
iz er, ikh hob im ongeshribn a brivele

00:02:51.502 --> 00:02:52.817
⟨a⟩ poylish,

00:02:52.817 --> 00:02:54.259
un ikh hob ir gez-

00:02:54.259 --> 00:02:57.547
vayl zey hobn gezogt ah ikh bin dokh a CIOTKA zeyers

00:02:57.705 --> 00:03:00.264
⟨hob ikh gekent⟩, zey kenen mikh, kh'bin a CIOTKA.

00:03:00.507 --> 00:03:05.073
iz, iz zi geforn,

00:03:05.181 --> 00:03:09.427
hobn zey geshikt de- dem sheygets un er hot gebrengt mayn tokhter.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.425
azoy az mayn tokhter iz shoyn geven lebn mir.

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.932
hob ikh shoyn gehat mayn tokhter lebn mir.

00:03:14.952 --> 00:03:17.274
yene hob ikh arayngegebn hob ikh gevust

00:03:17.584 --> 00:03:20.863
az s'vet borekhashem zayn beseyder,

00:03:20.863 --> 00:03:23.073
vayl ikh hob gekent di goyim.

00:03:23.073 --> 00:03:26.018
zey zenen geven zeyer ⟨orntlekh un⟩ fayne mentshn.

00:03:26.018 --> 00:03:27.973
ikh bin oykh a molt geven bay zey.

00:03:28.767 --> 00:03:33.337
un do bin ikh shoyn geven a bisl azoy UNK gehat di tokhter ⟨bay mir⟩.

00:03:33.531 --> 00:03:36.394
un nakher hot geshi-

00:03:36.872 --> 00:03:41.003
dem der der der der MANAGER hot gevolt ikh zol geyn

00:03:41.003 --> 00:03:45.011
mit im voynen dortn ahin vu er hot gevoynt ergets in

00:03:45.011 --> 00:03:48.948
in s'iz geven lebn

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:54.602
vi hot es geheysn? in v- WALTFEIN tsi vu ergets?

00:03:56.025 --> 00:03:59.039
s'iz geven tif in mizrekh ⟨dortn⟩ bin ikh geven.

00:04:00.463 --> 00:04:01.983
hob ikh nisht gevolt

00:04:01.983 --> 00:04:04.929
zogt er "hostu nisht keyn rekht do tsu

00:04:05.087 --> 00:04:07.168
tsu arbetn

00:04:07.168 --> 00:04:10.307
muzstu geyn in a lager arayn arbetn"

00:04:10.307 --> 00:04:14.430
zog ikh "vel ikh geyn in a lager" hob ikh gezogt "ikh vil geyn mit mayn tokhter.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:17.029
vu ikh zol geyn ⟨zol ikh⟩ mitnemen mayn tokhter".

00:04:17.052 --> 00:04:19.468
hob ikh mitgenumen di tokhter

00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:21.973
un dos iz geven a ⟨far shvues⟩.

00:04:22.502 --> 00:04:23.815
far shvues?

00:04:22.519 --> 00:04:27.261
⟨ye⟩, dos iz geven nayn monatn bin ikh geven bay dem daytsh.

00:04:23.815 --> 00:04:25.368
dos iz geven

00:04:25.368 --> 00:04:27.491
dos iz nisht geven in finef un fertsikstn?

00:04:27.261 --> 00:04:30.586
dos hot gemuzt zayn der fir un fertsikster, yo.

00:04:29.877 --> 00:04:32.841
far shvues, s- s'iz zumertsayt?

00:04:31.632 --> 00:04:37.110
yo, vayl ikh gedenk s'iz geven azoy

00:04:37.538 --> 00:04:41.382
BOŻE NARODZENIE dakht zikh mir iz men gevezn do

00:04:41.382 --> 00:04:44.113
yo, s'iz geven far shvues, hot es gemuzt zayn.

00:04:44.878 --> 00:04:47.094
zenen mir, azoy ⟨oykh vu⟩

00:04:47.094 --> 00:04:49.966
v- hob ikh mitgenumen mayn tokhter

00:04:49.966 --> 00:04:51.740
un er hot undz avekgefirt

00:04:51.949 --> 00:04:54.573
dort arayn ergets in a shtot

00:04:54.573 --> 00:04:56.263
me hot undz ⟨arayn⟩geshribn,

00:04:56.286 --> 00:04:59.029
kh'gedenk oykh nisht vi di shtot hot geheysn,

00:04:59.029 --> 00:05:01.564
in a groyse shtot, er hot undz ⟨arayn⟩geshribn,

00:05:01.564 --> 00:05:03.226
me iz arayn in dem lager.

00:05:03.226 --> 00:05:07.547
di der untersheyd iz geven a groyse, do geven a private shtub

00:05:07.547 --> 00:05:08.936
vos me hot gelebt

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.951
zey hobn mikh gut gehaltn, ikh kon nisht zogn,

00:05:11.951 --> 00:05:16.094
kh'bin gezesn bay zey tsuzamen, me hot gezesn bay eyn tish un me hot gegesn.

00:05:16.094 --> 00:05:17.925
un s'iz geven vos tsu esn.

00:05:17.925 --> 00:05:23.181
in dem lager, ⟨sh- veyst⟩ UNK, vi s'iz geveyntlekh ⟨far⟩ a lager, dos iz gevezn rusn,

00:05:23.181 --> 00:05:24.894
un s'i- gefangene,

00:05:24.894 --> 00:05:27.836
un s'iz geven rusishe fun fun Rusland,

00:05:28.095 --> 00:05:29.641
un s'iz gevezn

00:05:29.715 --> 00:05:32.066
italyener iz gevezn,

00:05:32.066 --> 00:05:37.539
gefangene s'iz geven, englishe gefangene zenen dort gevezn.

00:05:38.136 --> 00:05:39.412
un

00:05:40.515 --> 00:05:42.348
ikh hob gearbet oyfn feld

00:05:42.928 --> 00:05:44.477
mit ale glaykh

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:49.012
ober ikh hob nisht gekent nokhdonzhen di arbet vi zey hobn gearbet.

00:05:49.012 --> 00:05:52.544
zey zenen geven kristn vos hobn gehat land

00:05:52.544 --> 00:05:54.940
un ale hobn gekent arbetn ⟨in⟩ land.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:59.378
ikh hob nisht gekent arbetn ⟨in⟩ land, vi ikh hob gekent bindn di

00:05:59.378 --> 00:06:01.329
di WIĄZKI, s'iz shoyn geven

00:06:01.329 --> 00:06:05.301
dos NA NA WIO- WIOSNĘ, NA zhnive s'iz geven

00:06:02.723 --> 00:06:03.544
zhnives

00:06:05.301 --> 00:06:07.289
vi me hot gebindn di,

00:06:07.296 --> 00:06:09.500
shtelt aykh for,

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.189
es iz geven an alter

00:06:12.189 --> 00:06:14.223
vos hot der hot akht gegebn oyf undz.

00:06:14.223 --> 00:06:18.569
hot geheysn der der forzeer

00:06:18.569 --> 00:06:20.746
hot er geheysn SHIMENFELD

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:23.172
SHIMENFELD aza alter mentsh a mentsh

00:06:23.172 --> 00:06:25.738
kh'veys nisht ⟨geven di⟩ akhtsik avade.

00:06:25.738 --> 00:06:27.413
hot er undz gehitn.

00:06:27.413 --> 00:06:30.679
eyn mol hot es ged- dem ha- dortn dem

00:06:30.679 --> 00:06:34.798
hoyf in dem lager iz geven a inspektor,

00:06:34.798 --> 00:06:37.265
vos er iz geforn arum oyf a ferd

00:06:37.265 --> 00:06:40.452
un hot vider nokh ⟨a mol⟩ inspektirt

00:06:40.452 --> 00:06:42.916
⟨vi nokh⟩ di arbet geyt dort tsu.

00:06:42.916 --> 00:06:45.113
iz er ale mol gekumen oyfn feld.

00:06:45.113 --> 00:06:47.493
ikh bin shtendik geblibn di letste.

00:06:47.493 --> 00:06:50.046
bin ikh gearbet lebn mayn tokhter,

00:06:50.046 --> 00:06:54.905
hot mayn tokhter gemakht ir arbet un zi hot mir oykhet aroysgeholfn.

00:06:54.905 --> 00:06:57.546
afile mit di WIĄZKes vos me hot gebindn

00:06:57.546 --> 00:06:59.835
hot zi gedonzhet ire tsu makhn

00:06:59.835 --> 00:07:01.664
zi hot ⟨oykh⟩ gedonzhet mir tsu makhn.

00:07:01.664 --> 00:07:03.975
ober az s'iz gekumen bay dem ⟨pyelyen⟩

00:07:03.975 --> 00:07:05.393
veyst vos heyst pyelyen?

00:07:05.393 --> 00:07:07.162
di dos grinvarg

00:07:07.489 --> 00:07:09.493
⟨arayngemakht⟩

00:07:07.857 --> 00:07:10.005
 yo, yo, kh'veys.

00:07:09.493 --> 00:07:11.836
kh'hob nisht gekont nokhdonzhen.

00:07:12.062 --> 00:07:14.368
flegt der inspektor zogn

00:07:14.644 --> 00:07:16.427
"⟨vu⟩ iz ⟨zi⟩ DUBLIKA

00:07:16.517 --> 00:07:19.633
di ka- di arbet dokh nisht ⟨di⟩ DUBLIKA,

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:21.652
zi iz nokh SO vayt fun HIER".

00:07:21.652 --> 00:07:24.107
hot der SHIMENFELD der alter gezogt

00:07:24.107 --> 00:07:27.277
"SIE ARBEIT LANGSAM ABER GUT".

00:07:27.486 --> 00:07:31.578
ikh hob gemeynt UNK me zol UNK ales grine vos toyg nisht

00:07:31.578 --> 00:07:33.072
iberlozt bloyz dos.

00:07:33.072 --> 00:07:36.812
ober di kristn hobn shoyn gevust, hobn zey gemakht kheylek yo, kheylek nisht.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.854
makht "di DUBLIKA,

00:07:38.854 --> 00:07:42.026
SIE ARBEIT LANGSAM ABER SIE ARBEIT GUT".

00:07:42.589 --> 00:07:46.163
zey hobn nisht gekont zogn "DUBLICKA" hobn zey gezogt "DUBLIKA"

00:07:46.163 --> 00:07:47.071
oyf mir.

00:07:47.348 --> 00:07:52.154
shoyn, ah gezen kh'loy- kh- s'loynt zikh im nisht tsu ikh zol arbetn oyfn feld.

00:07:52.154 --> 00:07:54.379
hot er mikh arayngenumen in di kukh arayn

00:07:54.908 --> 00:07:56.813
alts ARBEIT in di kukh

00:07:56.813 --> 00:07:59.137
tsu sheyln kartofl un tsu kokhn.

00:07:59.532 --> 00:08:00.454
nu shoyn.

00:08:00.544 --> 00:08:02.461
hot er mikh arayngenumen in di kukh,

00:08:02.461 --> 00:08:03.891
far mir iz geven beser.

00:08:03.891 --> 00:08:05.567
kh'hob gearbet in di kukh.

00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:07.442
mayn tokhter vider

00:08:07.442 --> 00:08:09.079
hot zey zeyer gefoln.

00:08:09.079 --> 00:08:13.534
dort z'iz geven a gute arbetorin un z'iz arayngenumen in a shpaykhler arayn.

00:08:13.534 --> 00:08:15.506
ir veyst vos a shpaykhler iz?

00:08:15.512 --> 00:08:16.766
dos iz a

00:08:16.766 --> 00:08:21.381
aza MAKHSAN vos me ⟨geyt⟩ aroys far di ferd tsu esn,

00:08:21.381 --> 00:08:23.364
far di beheymes.

00:08:23.364 --> 00:08:25.724
zi hot geven baym ⟨vogn⟩.

00:08:25.724 --> 00:08:28.914
zi hot z'iz geven zeyer a feike, zeyer a feike! borekhashem,

00:08:28.914 --> 00:08:32.400
keyneynore z'iz zeyer, bizn hayntikn tog z'iz zeyer aza

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.676
ZARADNA vi me hot gezogt.

00:08:35.222 --> 00:08:40.060
un zi hot ⟨azoy UNK oys zikh ayngekrign⟩ bay zey. zi iz geven kleyn, zi iz a kleyne

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.566
un zi hot azoy ales gemakht gut.

00:08:42.566 --> 00:08:45.963
hobn zey zi arayngenumen dortn in dem MAKHSAN

00:08:45.963 --> 00:08:47.563
un zi hot getayet

00:08:47.563 --> 00:08:49.340
di d- dos far di

00:08:49.347 --> 00:08:51.888
un ah ⟨geven oykh a⟩ a

00:08:51.928 --> 00:08:54.498
hert oys, shoyn arbet hot men ge⟨UNK⟩

00:08:54.498 --> 00:09:00.514
zikher, s'iz geven a a kh'hob gear- geshlofn mit a kristin vos iz geven zeyer nisht keyn

00:09:00.514 --> 00:09:03.068
z'iz geven a dinst a molt bay yidn.

00:09:03.068 --> 00:09:05.625
z'iz geven a shabes-

00:09:05.631 --> 00:09:07.889
helferin, a heytserin

00:09:07.889 --> 00:09:11.919
un z'iz geven zeyer a groyse antisemitke, zi iz nisht geven keyn tsu kluge.

00:09:12.128 --> 00:09:15.384
hot zi, hot zi zikh, hot zi mikh mekane gevezn

00:09:15.384 --> 00:09:18.607
me hot mikh genumen in in di kukh arayn.

00:09:18.607 --> 00:09:20.307
zi hot gearbet oyf feld.

00:09:20.307 --> 00:09:23.411
oyf feld iz men aroysgeganen fir bay der nakht tsu der arbet.

00:09:23.721 --> 00:09:27.444
kh'hob do oykhet oyfgeshtanen fir, fir hot men gemuzt oyfshteyn.

00:09:27.585 --> 00:09:31.342
un fire zenen mir oyfgeshtanen, ⟨in⟩ di kikh kh'bin oykh arayngeganen fire.

00:09:34.875 --> 00:09:38.905
iz di DUBLIKA, di di goye hot mikh mekane geven,

00:09:38.905 --> 00:09:42.609
hot zi nor gezogt azoy vi zi iz geven gevoynt mit yidn,

00:09:42.609 --> 00:09:43.829
hot zi

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:46.850
zikh arayngenumen in kop arayn az ikh bin,

00:09:47.768 --> 00:09:51.609
az ikh bin epes azoy a bisele enlekh tsu a yidishe,

00:09:51.632 --> 00:09:52.489
yo.

00:09:52.489 --> 00:09:54.489
un hot gezogt tsu a goye

00:09:54.489 --> 00:09:56.131
tsu an andere goye

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:59.945
az ikh bin a yidishe, ⟨tsu hern⟩ di goye

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.783
hot di di andere goye vider gezogt

00:10:02.783 --> 00:10:06.099
ikh me hot dokh gelebt mit ale gut vos heyst

00:10:06.099 --> 00:10:07.871
zogt zi "vos redstu?

00:10:07.871 --> 00:10:09.204
vos redstu?

00:10:09.204 --> 00:10:14.039
fun di FELKE's" FELE, mayn tokhter heyst FELE, zey hobn oyf ir geshrign "FELKA"

00:10:14.039 --> 00:10:15.988
"FELKE'S mame iz a yidishe"

00:10:15.988 --> 00:10:21.579
"vos redstu? du zest nisht dos redstu?" zey hobn zi gehaltn far a meshugene.

00:10:21.805 --> 00:10:22.856
zogt zi,

00:10:22.856 --> 00:10:23.924
zogt zi

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.524
"zest nisht" zogt zi "az zi iz a

00:10:26.597 --> 00:10:29.765
a UNK" zogt zi dos goye

00:10:29.765 --> 00:10:33.655
"zi geyt nisht in koshtshol du geyst zikh oykh nisht in koshtshol". zi iz oykh nisht geganen.

00:10:33.655 --> 00:10:38.187
ikh bin nisht geganen, ikh hob nisht gehat keyn tsayt tsu geyn in koshtshol. ven hob ikh gehat tsayt tsu geyn in koshtshol?

00:10:38.187 --> 00:10:41.508
zuntik hob ikh nisht gehat keyn tsayt, ikh hob gemuzt zayn in di kikh.

00:10:41.599 --> 00:10:46.335
kh'hob nisht gehat, ober FELKE iz gegan in koshtshol mit di shkotsim, mit di shikses arumgelofn.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:49.223
iz shoyn, dos iz a narishkeyt ah

00:10:49.223 --> 00:10:50.413
hot zi gezogt

00:10:50.413 --> 00:10:55.198
ober se s'iz nisht geven demolt keyn narishkeyt, ven zi zogt dos ⟨far⟩ inspektor

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.363
sakone iz geven.

00:10:55.198 --> 00:10:57.506
iz ⟨⟩ iz s'iz geven mamesh a sakone.

00:10:57.597 --> 00:11:00.049
un zi hot gezen ikh hob gehat dos

00:11:00.049 --> 00:11:02.754
zey hobn zikh mit mir gekhavert di goyim ale.

00:11:02.929 --> 00:11:04.830
⟨zi⟩ ikh hob nisht ⟨keyn⟩

00:11:03.199 --> 00:11:05.770
di dokumentn hot keyner nisht gefregt?

00:11:05.258 --> 00:11:09.251
keyn mol ⟨hot men⟩ nisht, keyn mol hot ⟨men⟩ mikh nisht gefregt gornisht.

00:11:09.471 --> 00:11:10.390
a mazl.

00:11:10.131 --> 00:11:11.647
dos iz geven a mazl.

00:11:11.772 --> 00:11:13.355
un shtelt aykh for,

00:11:13.355 --> 00:11:16.710
un azoy bin ikh ⟨opge- op- geven nayn⟩ monatn.

00:11:16.716 --> 00:11:18.282
biz me hot ge-

00:11:18.282 --> 00:11:21.266
yo, in di kikh iz shoyn geven nisht shlekht.

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:24.931
far vos? me hot gehat koydem UNK tsu esn ge- dos

00:11:24.931 --> 00:11:27.574
kartofl iz geven genug

00:11:27.574 --> 00:11:29.045
un

00:11:29.586 --> 00:11:33.000
tsu di kartofl veyst ir vos s'iz geven far a zakhn

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.526
ikh hob keyn fleysh bay di goyim nisht gegesn.

00:11:35.667 --> 00:11:40.031
di gantse yor vos m'iz geven bay di goyim hob ikh keyn fleysh nisht gegesn.

00:11:41.438 --> 00:11:45.092
kh'hob gezogt "kh'bin krank oyf ⟨iyen⟩, ikh tor nisht esn keyn fleysh".

00:11:45.092 --> 00:11:48.687
un shoyn, me hot keyner, s'hot mir keyner gornisht gemakht keyn UNK.

00:11:48.694 --> 00:11:49.830
un azoy,

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.678
yetst do in di kikh

00:11:51.678 --> 00:11:54.391
iz geven yedn zuntik s'iz geven a

00:11:54.567 --> 00:11:56.774
a a gulash,

00:11:56.774 --> 00:11:59.018
iz gelegn dort a shtikele fleysh,

00:11:59.018 --> 00:12:02.056
iz mayn portsye vos ikh hob genumen far mir

00:12:02.056 --> 00:12:04.028
hob ikh gegebn far mayn tokhter.

00:12:04.843 --> 00:12:10.949
un d- hot zi ⟨tsu⟩ vider avekge⟨UNK⟩ ir portsye kartofl zi hot gehat tsvey portsyes UNK dem dem gulash.

00:12:10.949 --> 00:12:13.342
keyn kartofl hot ⟨zikher oykh⟩ nisht gefelt.

00:12:13.348 --> 00:12:18.942
azoy az di goyim hobn oyf undz dos az UNK avek dayn esn

00:12:18.942 --> 00:12:23.973
me vet UNK dir oykh epes gebn, me hot dokh alts gekrign a PRZYDZIAŁ a

00:12:24.688 --> 00:12:26.804
iz vos, a bisl tsuker,

00:12:26.804 --> 00:12:30.673
un a bisele RIBA,

00:12:31.455 --> 00:12:33.086
un un broyt.

00:12:33.565 --> 00:12:38.919
iz azoy broyt az ikh hob gehat kartofl, hob ikh gegesn kartofl, hob ikh nisht gevolt esn dos broyt.

00:12:38.919 --> 00:12:41.942
kh'hob dokh gevust ⟨s'vet zikh⟩ UNK ⟨vet⟩ muzn zayn an ende.

00:12:41.942 --> 00:12:43.528
hob ikh gezogt tsu mayn tokhter

00:12:43.528 --> 00:12:46.353
"her oys, undz ⟨muz ikh⟩ onzamlen a bisl broyt

00:12:46.353 --> 00:12:49.837
efsher vi s'vet zikh makhn, ⟨zol mir⟩ blaybn khotsh a bisl broyt.

00:12:49.837 --> 00:12:50.816
se muz

00:12:50.816 --> 00:12:53.912
s'hot dokh nisht geendikt di milkhome, ⟨vet men undz nisht⟩ haltn shtendik".

00:12:53.912 --> 00:12:57.572
ikh hob mir opge- opgeprozhet a bisl broyt

00:12:57.865 --> 00:13:02.013
un ikh dos mir shpeter gants gut tsu nits gekumen ven s'hot zikh geendikt,

00:13:02.013 --> 00:13:03.580
me hot undz aroysgeshikt,

00:13:03.855 --> 00:13:07.210
aroysgenumen fun di betn, me hot undz genumen aroyf oyf a

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:08.642
oyf a oyto

00:13:08.648 --> 00:13:12.084
un m'iz ge- me hot undz geshikt UNK

00:13:12.529 --> 00:13:16.053
un un me hot nisht UNK hobn undz gegebn a

00:13:16.053 --> 00:13:18.162
eynem vos hot gefirt di oyto

00:13:18.162 --> 00:13:20.521
tifer arayn in Daytshland arayn.

00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:22.851
dos iz shoyn geven bay ende.

00:13:23.042 --> 00:13:26.203
iz shoyn dos veys ikh nisht, ikh hob gekrign,

00:13:26.203 --> 00:13:29.499
shtelt aykh for, do vu mayn tokhter iz gevezn

00:13:30.822 --> 00:13:35.743
mayn tokhter iz gevezn un do vu ikh bin geven vos m'iz geganen nokh Daytshland.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:39.742
hob hob ikh gezogt tsu sheygets zog ikh

00:13:39.951 --> 00:13:42.982
"kh'vil epes hobn a a shtikele epes epes"

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.733
az se zoln visn az s- s-

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:48.534
az" ikh hob mikh gevolt azoy farzikhern mit epes.

00:13:49.603 --> 00:13:52.823
veys ikh nisht in a sheynem tog, s'iz geven a zuntik,

00:13:52.823 --> 00:13:54.896
krig ikh a telegrame,

00:13:54.896 --> 00:13:56.724
shtelt aykh for,

00:13:56.724 --> 00:13:59.199
ah "B- BABCIA UMARŁA"

00:14:01.129 --> 00:14:05.150
di di di bobe geshtorbn hot men mir geshikt ni- ah

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.356
ho- me hot dos shoyn gekrogn khoyshed zayn

00:14:07.356 --> 00:14:10.100
⟨ah⟩ ikh krig a telegrame "BABCIA UMARŁA".

00:14:10.849 --> 00:14:12.938
UNK

00:14:12.938 --> 00:14:15.891
nokh azelkhe zakhn, tsi kumt BOŻE NARODZENIE

00:14:15.891 --> 00:14:17.913
hot mikh gevolt aheymshikn.

00:14:18.257 --> 00:14:21.431
ikh hob nisht gevolt forn ober kh'⟨vel⟩ dokh nisht zogn "ikh ⟨vel⟩ nisht forn"

00:14:21.431 --> 00:14:22.554
ale hobn zikh gefreyt,

00:14:22.554 --> 00:14:24.917
me shikt tsu heym BOŻE NARODZENIE

00:14:24.917 --> 00:14:26.351
hot men zey aheymgeshikt

00:14:26.678 --> 00:14:28.005
ho- ho-

00:14:28.213 --> 00:14:30.025
hob ikh oykh gezogt "kh'for".

00:14:30.025 --> 00:14:33.719
ikh'hob dokh ⟨hob ikh⟩ gemuzt zogn, ikh hob nisht getort zogn

00:14:33.719 --> 00:14:37.222
"kh'for nisht", s'iz ge- a groyse simkhe geven, di greste simkhe.

00:14:37.222 --> 00:14:39.749
me shikt undz aheym oyf tsvey dray tog.

00:14:40.296 --> 00:14:41.640
zog ikh

00:14:42.085 --> 00:14:43.952
dem zelbn bay di nakht

00:14:45.949 --> 00:14:48.676
mayn tokhter z'iz gevorn krank.

00:14:48.902 --> 00:14:52.721
UNK gedakht, hot ongehoybn bay der nakht tsu krekhtsn

00:14:52.721 --> 00:14:54.493
un zi hot nisht gekont redn.

00:14:54.493 --> 00:14:58.261
zi hot gekrign a anttsindung in haldz un s'iz geven geferlekh!

00:14:59.652 --> 00:15:01.597
ikh heyb mikh oyf

00:15:01.597 --> 00:15:03.611
zog ikh "veyst FELA,

00:15:04.647 --> 00:15:08.786
kh'vel" zog ikh "geyn meldn az du bist krank, ⟨muz men⟩ forn tsu a dokter".

00:15:08.786 --> 00:15:10.850
dort keyn dokter iz nisht geven.

00:15:11.802 --> 00:15:16.825
gey ikh arop tsun ikh hob der der SHIMENFELD er hot gehit bay ⟨der⟩ nakht.

00:15:16.948 --> 00:15:21.662
bin ikh tsugeganen, alts poylish, ikh hob geredt poylish, zey hobn ⟨dokh⟩ nisht gekont keyn poylish.

00:15:21.662 --> 00:15:25.717
un ikh hob nisht gekont keyn daytsh, ⟨ikh hob dort⟩ nisht getort zogn az ikh kon daytsh.

00:15:26.668 --> 00:15:27.978
un ikh zog im,

00:15:28.339 --> 00:15:31.421
kh'vayz im zi iz krank, s'tut ir vey, ⟨zi k-⟩.

00:15:32.035 --> 00:15:33.728
er hot mikh nisht farshtanen.

00:15:33.728 --> 00:15:35.944
hot er oyfgevekt dort emetsn

00:15:36.017 --> 00:15:40.013
un hot gefregt vos ikh red, hot men UNK gezogt

00:15:40.013 --> 00:15:41.900
az FELA nisht gezunt

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.362
un me m- muz geyn tsu a dokter

00:15:44.362 --> 00:15:46.078
⟨tsi⟩ vos me zol epes tun.

00:15:46.078 --> 00:15:49.189
iz er geganen hot gezogt gemoldn baym inspektor

00:15:49.189 --> 00:15:52.379
hot inspektor gezogt zol geyn dort epes.

00:15:52.583 --> 00:15:54.559
me hot zi nisht genumen tsu keyn dokter.

00:15:54.559 --> 00:15:57.453
⟨⟩ UNK me hot UNK gegebn epes in haldz.

00:15:57.453 --> 00:15:59.580
un s'iz borekhashem ⟨UNK⟩geganen.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.239
zenen mir nisht geforn oyf,

00:16:01.347 --> 00:16:03.400
dos iz oykh bay mir geven a nes.

00:16:03.692 --> 00:16:06.415
hot men nisht geforn oyf BOŻE NARODZENIE.

00:16:06.418 --> 00:16:11.971
makht gornisht keyn UNK forst nisht oyf BOŻE NARODZENIE vestu forn oyf NOWY ROK.

00:16:13.699 --> 00:16:15.768
un bay mir iz geven a nes!

00:16:16.095 --> 00:16:18.689
⟨mir⟩ ikh hob nisht gevolt zol zayn krank, kholile,

00:16:18.689 --> 00:16:21.256
ober s'iz geven UNK a nes,

00:16:21.256 --> 00:16:24.344
az me hot, zi hot nisht ged-, me hot nisht gedarft tsu forn.

00:16:24.344 --> 00:16:26.332
m'iz geblibn in lager.

00:16:26.625 --> 00:16:29.001
un azoy iz adurkhgeganen di der

00:16:29.001 --> 00:16:30.905
der BOŻE NARODZENIE,

00:16:31.131 --> 00:16:33.087
un dos iz es, shoyn.

00:16:33.087 --> 00:16:35.347
s'iz geshen, s'iz nesn nisim gesheen.

00:16:35.347 --> 00:16:39.495
der vos iz geblibn lebn SO WIE SO iz nisht iz epes geshen.

00:16:40.227 --> 00:16:42.819
kh'veys nisht s'iz epes ⟨a got⟩ UNK

00:16:41.239 --> 00:16:44.895
dos iz shoyn geven ende, onfang finef un fertsik

00:16:44.243 --> 00:16:48.000
dos iz geven der onfang, yo, dos iz geven der onfang.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:51.965
ir hot gevust vos tut zikh in der velt demolst? ir hot farshtanen az di rusn geyen foroys?

00:16:51.844 --> 00:16:55.326
neyn, dos hob ikh nisht gekont visn, ⟨v- vant ge- keyn tsaytung⟩

00:16:54.317 --> 00:16:56.700
nisht gehert keyn nayes? me hot nisht geredt?

00:16:55.862 --> 00:17:00.652
neyn, gornisht hot ⟨er⟩ nisht gevorn. UNK ikh bin geven bay di DEUTSCHEN

00:17:00.662 --> 00:17:03.828
ven ikh bin geven nisht eyder ikh bin geganen in a lager arayn

00:17:03.987 --> 00:17:05.844
demolt hob ikh gevust,

00:17:05.844 --> 00:17:09.538
vayl zey hobn geleyent a tsaytung, ⟨zey⟩ UNK ⟨yedn tog⟩ a tsaytung

00:17:09.538 --> 00:17:14.353
s'iz geshtanen geferlekh, geferlekh, geferlekh, s'iz zign azoy f- gut

00:17:14.353 --> 00:17:17.357
az yedn tog zenen zey

00:17:17.357 --> 00:17:18.965
zenen zey neenter

00:17:19.156 --> 00:17:23.336
tsu tsu ts- tsu nemen di velt.

00:17:23.578 --> 00:17:25.456
ale tog iz geshtanen

00:17:25.456 --> 00:17:29.681
f- vi hot vi ⟨dos iz⟩ geshtanen? dos kepele gevezn

00:17:30.042 --> 00:17:32.924
"der hunt", "DIE HUNDE", "DIE DREI HUNDE".

00:17:32.924 --> 00:17:35.081
DIE DREI HUNDE dos iz geven

00:17:36.083 --> 00:17:37.526
Amerike, England

00:17:37.332 --> 00:17:41.089
England avade, Amerike, CHURCHILL

00:17:39.676 --> 00:17:40.317
Rus-

00:17:41.348 --> 00:17:43.316
CHURCHILL dakht zikh mir

00:17:43.356 --> 00:17:44.956
un STALIN

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:45.442
un ROOSEVELT

00:17:44.956 --> 00:17:46.657
un ROOSEVELT.

00:17:46.714 --> 00:17:48.204
DIE DREI HUNDE.

00:17:48.204 --> 00:17:52.017
dos hob ikh ge- yedn tog iz geshtanen oyf di tsaytung

00:17:52.017 --> 00:17:53.408
"DIE DREI HUNDE".

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.984
yetst ikh ⟨hob⟩ gevolt fregn nokh a fr-, nokh eyn frage.

00:17:54.696 --> 00:17:57.461
dos hob ikh geleyent, vayl daytsh hob ikh gekent.

00:17:57.461 --> 00:17:59.314
dos hob ikh gelernt.

00:17:58.113 --> 00:18:03.127
nokh eyn frage zayendik in Daytshland, bay di daytshn, far dem vi me hot aykh arayngefirt in lager arayn dortn

00:18:01.665 --> 00:18:02.469
yo

00:18:03.775 --> 00:18:05.532
hot ir,

00:18:05.532 --> 00:18:08.342
ir hot ⟨aykh⟩ geshpilt az ir zent a poylishe?

00:18:07.791 --> 00:18:09.083
yo

00:18:09.377 --> 00:18:11.059
ba- z- zayendik bay zey

00:18:10.892 --> 00:18:11.634
yo

00:18:11.059 --> 00:18:15.265
hot ir epes gehert UNK redn vegn vos tut zikh mit yidn, az me harget oys yidn?

00:18:15.078 --> 00:18:18.063
yo, yo, yo, shtendik, yo me hot gevust.

00:18:15.265 --> 00:18:20.346
epes hobn geredt vegn dem? ⟨zey⟩ hobn gevust? zey hobn gevust vos tut zikh? ⟨zey hobn gevust⟩

00:18:18.063 --> 00:18:20.350
zey hobn ales gevust, vegn altsding ales.

00:18:20.346 --> 00:18:22.459
zey hobn ⟨fleg ir⟩ redn vegn dem?

00:18:20.417 --> 00:18:21.198
yo, yo

00:18:21.818 --> 00:18:23.093
yo, yo, yo, yo

00:18:22.459 --> 00:18:24.660
az me ⟨farnikht⟩ di yidn ⟨hot oykh⟩

00:18:23.612 --> 00:18:25.757
yo, yo, dos hobn zey gezogt.

00:18:25.757 --> 00:18:27.849
zey hobn gezogt s'vet nisht blaybn a yid.

00:18:28.141 --> 00:18:30.279
dos hot ir yo gehert fun zeyer mayler?

00:18:28.564 --> 00:18:31.005
yo, yo, dos hob ikh gehert.

00:18:31.095 --> 00:18:33.451
ikh hob ⟨gemeynt⟩, ikh hob gegleybt azoy.

00:18:33.981 --> 00:18:36.741
vayl az ikh bin arayngekumen hob ikh gemeynt

00:18:36.741 --> 00:18:40.404
s'iz shoyn take ek velt

00:18:39.145 --> 00:18:41.047
vos zhe iz pasirt shpeter?

00:18:41.047 --> 00:18:43.982
s'iz onfang finef un fertsik. vos geshet yetst?

00:18:43.262 --> 00:18:47.643
⟨do⟩ nakher hot men aroyf- yo ven me hot undz aroysgefirt shoyn fun Daytshland

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:52.506
nokh nisht fun Daytshland, me hot zikh dernokh arumgedreyt a por tog.

00:18:52.506 --> 00:18:54.005
biz m-

00:18:54.045 --> 00:18:57.298
der oytobus hot undz ibergelozt

00:18:57.298 --> 00:18:59.931
un me hot zikh tseteylt ⟨nor⟩

00:18:59.931 --> 00:19:03.134
⟨fun⟩ a shtot. gedenk ikh oykh nisht vi di shtot heyst.

00:19:06.448 --> 00:19:08.095
⟨te un faktisher⟩

00:19:07.512 --> 00:19:10.223
gedenk ikh oykh nisht vi di shtot heyst.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:14.003
hot me dort, ⟨kh'bin⟩ arayn

00:19:14.042 --> 00:19:15.499
un

00:19:15.499 --> 00:19:18.673
di gay- di goyim zenen bald geganen arum in di shtubn

00:19:18.673 --> 00:19:21.489
un zey hobn genumen vos zey hobn dort gefunen

00:19:21.489 --> 00:19:24.428
un ikh mit mayn tokhter hot men zikh oykh arumgedreyt.

00:19:24.428 --> 00:19:27.680
"mame" zogt zi "ikh'el oykh geyn nemen". zog ikh "neyn, du vest nisht geyn nemen.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.623
ikh hob nisht ⟨vu⟩ tsu nemen, ikh veys nisht

00:19:29.623 --> 00:19:32.213
vos mit dem un ikh vil nisht nemen.

00:19:32.213 --> 00:19:33.510
ikh nem nisht"

00:19:33.718 --> 00:19:36.715
makht zi zikh shlepn UNK zog ikh "gey nisht".

00:19:36.756 --> 00:19:39.334
hot zi nisht ge⟨UNK⟩, beshum-oyfn nisht

00:19:39.334 --> 00:19:41.308
zol nisht geyn, ikh hob nisht gevolt.

00:19:41.308 --> 00:19:44.124
un me hot zikh gehaltn gut, un me hot zikh gehaltn.

00:19:44.265 --> 00:19:46.588
un nakher biz zenen ongekumen di rusn.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:47.786
UNK

00:19:47.033 --> 00:19:49.080
eyn molt ⟨iz men⟩ adurkhgeganen

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.942
⟨iz⟩ geshtanen a fur

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.953
a a gepakte,

00:19:52.953 --> 00:19:54.148
a vogn,

00:19:54.492 --> 00:19:56.885
a vogn mit zakhn ful gepakt,

00:19:56.885 --> 00:20:00.291
un tsvey kinder zenen zikh gedreyt lebn vogn.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.138
tsvey un hobn geveynt.

00:20:02.138 --> 00:20:04.746
dos iz geven di daytshn UNK antlofn

00:20:04.746 --> 00:20:07.836
hot men UNK kh'veys nisht tsi me hot geharget di eltern,

00:20:07.836 --> 00:20:09.600
tsi me hot zey tsugenumen

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.527
un di tsvey kinder zenen ⟨zey⟩ geshtanen lebn vogn

00:20:12.527 --> 00:20:13.959
un hobn geveynt.

00:20:14.387 --> 00:20:18.405
zog ikh azoy ⟨nebekh⟩ hot bay undz oysgezen, nokh erger.

00:20:18.405 --> 00:20:21.586
UNK ⟨zey hobn⟩ di kinder oykh bald avekgeharget.

00:20:18.572 --> 00:20:19.679
ven iz d-

00:20:21.441 --> 00:20:25.687
ven iz dos geven az me hot aykh az di rusn hobn fraytik geven?

00:20:24.847 --> 00:20:26.492
a fraytik gevezn

00:20:26.492 --> 00:20:27.746
vinter

00:20:27.567 --> 00:20:28.759
vinter

00:20:28.258 --> 00:20:31.441
LUTY iz geven ⟨s'iz in a⟩ februar.

00:20:29.473 --> 00:20:33.095
iz a ⟨s'iz nokh geven⟩ onfang finef un fertsik.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.817
yo, yo, UNK

00:20:33.591 --> 00:20:36.808
iz vu zent ir geganen ⟨demolstn⟩ nokhn bafrayen

00:20:36.594 --> 00:20:41.128
nokhn bafrayen zenen mir ar- hot vi zenen mir aroyf di rusishe, di rusishe,

00:20:41.128 --> 00:20:42.650
rusn hobn undz genumen.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.018
un me hot gezogt mir zenen fun Poyln.

00:20:45.018 --> 00:20:49.654
hobn zey undz gefirt, nisht hot men undz gefirt vayl zey hobn, vey zey hobn gemuzt adurkhgeyn.

00:20:49.654 --> 00:20:51.618
zenen adurkhgeganen mayn shtot,

00:20:51.618 --> 00:20:53.061
shtelt aykh for,

00:20:53.061 --> 00:20:55.860
un zey hobn undz mitgenumen biz in mayn shtot arayn.

00:20:57.081 --> 00:21:00.202
kh'veys nisht vi lang ⟨hot⟩ men geforn, m'hot geforn a

00:21:00.202 --> 00:21:04.437
a kh'veys nisht a nakht, a tog, vifl iz men geforn, tsi tsvey teg.

00:21:04.437 --> 00:21:06.710
vifl me hot gef- oyfn veg UNK ⟨gedenk nisht⟩

00:21:05.949 --> 00:21:08.887
nor dertseylt shoyn a bisl vos hot pasirt UNK ⟨fray⟩

00:21:07.511 --> 00:21:08.654
un demolt

00:21:08.654 --> 00:21:09.405
ha?

00:21:09.405 --> 00:21:13.342
demolt iz mir tsu nuts gekumen dos broyt vos ikh hob opgeprozhet

00:21:12.842 --> 00:21:13.933
di sukhares

00:21:13.382 --> 00:21:15.201
⟨hot⟩ dos di sukharkes

00:21:15.201 --> 00:21:17.088
fun dem hot men demolt gelebt.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:19.521
dos hob ikh hob ikh geha- ah dos

00:21:19.521 --> 00:21:21.796
⟨zikh⟩ zest di feler

00:21:22.309 --> 00:21:24.525
kh'hob gezogt, s'hot dokh kimat tsayt

00:21:24.525 --> 00:21:26.299
vet UNK ergets undz nemen

00:21:26.299 --> 00:21:30.591
me hot gemuzt ver veyst ⟨vi⟩ ikh, s'iz mir e- epes azoy ayngefaln,

00:21:30.591 --> 00:21:33.119
zog ikh "her oys, UNK est mit di kartofl

00:21:33.717 --> 00:21:35.162
zol zayn kartofl".

00:21:35.472 --> 00:21:40.596
ober ober demolt hot men shoyn gelebt gut, me hot gehat di sukhares, s'iz shoyn geven undzer lebn

00:21:40.652 --> 00:21:43.869
a por tog biz m'iz gekumen in ⟨undzer⟩ shtot arayn.

00:21:43.993 --> 00:21:46.636
m'iz gekumen in undzer shtot arayn,

00:21:48.195 --> 00:21:49.921
kh'bin ⟨gezesn⟩, keyner nishto.

00:21:49.921 --> 00:21:54.843
me hot gemeynt az undz zenen mir ⟨geblibn⟩ lebn, trakht efsher dokh nokh emetser iz geblibn. ver veyst?

00:21:54.843 --> 00:21:55.867
efsher lebn zey.

00:21:56.886 --> 00:21:59.546
mir zenen dort gevezn in undzer shtot,

00:22:00.632 --> 00:22:05.447
gekumen arayn di kristn undz oys-, kukn oyf undz zenen zey gekumen.

00:22:05.447 --> 00:22:09.083
eyn kristin hot mir gebrengt arayn, gedenk ikh, a shisl

00:22:09.083 --> 00:22:11.713
kartofl gekokhte mit fleysh,

00:22:11.922 --> 00:22:13.418
mit klopsn.

00:22:13.457 --> 00:22:17.400
dos iz geven dos ershte mol fun tsayt m'iz aroys

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:19.509
fun dort funem lager

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:23.458
vi me hot gegesn a bisl gekokhte esn.

00:22:23.717 --> 00:22:26.451
un azoy bizn, yo, in mayn hoyz iz geven

00:22:26.451 --> 00:22:30.299
kh'hob nisht gekont in mayn hoyz arayngeyn vayl mayn hoyz iz geven farnumen fun

00:22:30.299 --> 00:22:32.944
di fun di rusn.

00:22:32.944 --> 00:22:35.340
dos iz nokh nisht geven oyfgenumen Berlin.

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:41.514
un un un hobn zey kvartirt dort in mayn hoyz, ikh hob nisht gekont demolt arayngeyn.

00:22:41.571 --> 00:22:44.909
ikh bin arayngeganen, ikh, geven a shokhn an apteyker,

00:22:44.909 --> 00:22:48.096
bin ikh arayngeganen in der apteyk, ikh hob mikh mit im ⟨gerotn⟩.

00:22:48.096 --> 00:22:51.169
zog ikh "vos zol ikh tun? ikh bin gekumen mit mayn tokhter

00:22:51.169 --> 00:22:53.309
un ikh hob nisht ⟨vu⟩ arayntsugeyn".

00:22:53.653 --> 00:22:56.060
zogt er "geyt tsum soltis.

00:22:56.303 --> 00:22:59.276
der soltis vet dikh ergets aynordenen".

00:22:59.276 --> 00:23:01.990
ikh bin, demolt iz geven a rusisher komandir.

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:06.101
zog ikh "efsher zol ikh tsugeyn tsu di rusish komandir", makht er "gey nisht,

00:23:06.101 --> 00:23:08.593
me veyst nisht vi lang zey ⟨veln⟩ do zayn.

00:23:08.593 --> 00:23:10.302
beser" zogt er "gey nisht.

00:23:10.326 --> 00:23:13.225
geyt tsum soltis, er vet dir shoyn gebn ergets".

00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:17.069
un ⟨di⟩ soltis hot mikh a- ayngeordnt dort bay a shkheyne.

00:23:17.069 --> 00:23:19.838
zenen mir ibergenekhtikt tsvey tsi dray nekht,

00:23:19.838 --> 00:23:23.419
un nakher un zenen zey avek.

00:23:23.419 --> 00:23:26.185
zey hobn leyd gemakht di dires, zey zenen avek oyfn front.

00:23:26.185 --> 00:23:28.241
opnemen alts nokh Berlin.

00:23:28.416 --> 00:23:31.602
un nakher hot men opgenumen Berlin hot zikh geendikt di milkhome.

00:23:31.602 --> 00:23:34.198
nokh Berlin hot zikh ts- shoyn geendikt di milkhome.

00:23:33.006 --> 00:23:35.702
yo, dos iz shoyn geven may finef un fertsik.

00:23:35.149 --> 00:23:36.206
he?

00:23:35.702 --> 00:23:37.454
may finef un fertsik

00:23:37.225 --> 00:23:39.838
ven di milkho- ven di UNK

00:23:38.170 --> 00:23:41.184
zent ir nokh geven in ay-, zent ir shoyn geven in ayer shtot

00:23:40.345 --> 00:23:42.872
zenen geven zenen mir shoyn geven in mayn shtot.

00:23:42.895 --> 00:23:44.492
vos zhe hot ir vayter gemakht?

00:23:44.515 --> 00:23:47.448
tsen monatn hob ikh gevoynt in mayn shtub

00:23:47.448 --> 00:23:51.818
biz in ⟨eynem⟩ an ovnt, zenen mir gezesn mit kristn

00:23:51.818 --> 00:23:55.967
un mayne kinder hobn gehat zeyere khaveyrim, zenen nisht geganen in di shul

00:23:55.686 --> 00:23:59.106
a minut, ir hot mir nokh nisht dertseylt vi ⟨hot ir⟩ shoyn antdekt di tsveyte tokhter

00:23:59.078 --> 00:24:01.547
a di tsveyte tokhter ⟨z'iz⟩ geven noent,

00:24:01.547 --> 00:24:03.510
z'iz geven noent lebn mir.

00:24:02.925 --> 00:24:04.678
UNK gebrakht tsu zikh?

00:24:03.752 --> 00:24:07.474
neyn, ⟨hot er do-⟩, hob ikh gezogt "neyn, zol ⟨oykh⟩ dort zayn"

00:24:07.474 --> 00:24:10.870
ikh hob nokh nisht gehat gornisht, ikh hob dokh ⟨mikh⟩ aleynt nisht gehat vu tsu zayn.

00:24:10.870 --> 00:24:15.483
hob ikh bafoyln az zi zol, az zi zol nokh dort fun nokh nokh gornisht visn gemakht

00:24:15.483 --> 00:24:19.110
biz zi hot gekont ⟨nakher⟩, veys ikh nisht vu un ⟨oykh⟩ mit vemen,

00:24:19.110 --> 00:24:21.271
ikh hob gezogt az zi zol nokh nisht kumen

00:24:21.271 --> 00:24:22.714
biz kh'el hobn

00:24:22.714 --> 00:24:26.041
HELTSHE zayn ayngeordnt, zenen dokh bald gevor gevorn.

00:24:26.041 --> 00:24:29.110
me hot dokh mikh gekent, ikh bin dokh geven dort a geboyrene

00:24:29.110 --> 00:24:30.588
iz di ale kristn

00:24:30.588 --> 00:24:36.658
ah ah s- a vunder! eyn yidish kind iz aheymgekumen. ikh bin geven di eyntsike vos ⟨ikh bin⟩ gekumen.

00:24:35.499 --> 00:24:37.403
take mer keyner nisht gekumen?

00:24:36.999 --> 00:24:39.116
keyn eyner iz nisht gekumen mer.

00:24:39.257 --> 00:24:41.731
aheym in undzer shtetl iz keyner nisht gekumen.

00:24:41.923 --> 00:24:45.728
nakher, nakher, nokh efsher nokh ale di yor arum

00:24:45.728 --> 00:24:47.986
hot zikh opgerufn a shvegerin mayne

00:24:47.986 --> 00:24:50.973
vos iz geblibn lebn iz zi nisht gekumen

00:24:50.973 --> 00:24:53.783
aheym nokh SKĘPE, ⟨z'iz⟩ geforn nokh Lodzh.

00:24:53.783 --> 00:24:57.918
zey hobn gezogt UNK zol nisht forn nokh SKĘPE zenen nishto dort do keyn yidn

00:24:57.918 --> 00:25:00.373
iz zi geforn nokh Lodzh do vu s'iz yidn.

00:25:00.373 --> 00:25:02.893
z'iz geblibn lebn in SKARŻYSK

00:25:03.135 --> 00:25:08.783
mit mit kinder, di kinder zenen geven in di lagern un borekhashem, fir kinder zenen geblibn lebn.

00:25:08.783 --> 00:25:10.036
bloyz der man

00:25:10.036 --> 00:25:12.359
iz umgekumen demolt ven mayn man.

00:25:12.552 --> 00:25:16.292
iz biz vi lang zent ir geblibn in SKĘPE?

00:25:16.011 --> 00:25:21.032
kh'bin geblibn tsen monatn hob ikh gevoynt in SKĘPE, biz m'iz arayngekumen oyf der nakht,

00:25:21.032 --> 00:25:25.815
yo, nakher, hob ikh shoyn opgenumen mayn tokhter, ikh hob ongehoybn tsu handl tsu bislekh.

00:25:25.815 --> 00:25:27.744
m'iz gelofn zi opnemen

00:25:27.744 --> 00:25:29.825
hot men mir nisht gevolt zi gebn

00:25:29.899 --> 00:25:34.033
ikh hob genumen, ikh hob ⟨mikh⟩ araynge⟨numen⟩ tsu mir in di shtub, ikh hob gevizn

00:25:34.033 --> 00:25:37.572
ikh ⟨gib⟩ dir a dire, ikh hob a gehat a a hoyz mit

00:25:37.014 --> 00:25:39.005
dem polet vos hot ⟨dir aroysgevarft⟩

00:25:38.432 --> 00:25:41.490
yo, un UNK a undzers

00:25:41.490 --> 00:25:46.821
s'vet zayn dayne, s'vet zayn mayne, s'vet zayn anshtot shvester mayne vet zayn dayn vayb

00:25:46.821 --> 00:25:49.519
ikh hob gevolt me zol zayn tsuzamen.

00:25:49.693 --> 00:25:51.341
zey hobn nisht gevolt kumen.

00:25:51.341 --> 00:25:54.278
zey hobn nisht gevoynt tsu zayn in a, in a shtot, in a shtetl.

00:25:54.278 --> 00:25:56.317
s'iz nisht geven groys ober zey hobn nisht gevolt

00:25:56.317 --> 00:25:58.597
avek iberlozn zeyers un kumen.

00:25:58.873 --> 00:26:02.191
undz hot men gemuzt UNK avek ober zey hobn nisht gevolt.

00:26:03.042 --> 00:26:03.933
nu shoyn.

00:26:03.933 --> 00:26:06.326
nakher iz ⟨er⟩ gekumen arayn a goy

00:26:06.754 --> 00:26:09.802
tsveleve, efsher tsene, tsveleve oder eleve

00:26:10.348 --> 00:26:12.846
"CO HITLER NIE WYKOŃCZYŁ

00:26:12.846 --> 00:26:15.320
TO DZIŚ UNK WYKOŃCZYĆ MUSIM"

00:26:16.778 --> 00:26:18.647
un er hot zikh gemakht shiker

00:26:18.647 --> 00:26:20.900
tsi er iz gevezn shiker, ikh veys nisht.

00:26:20.900 --> 00:26:22.864
er UNK endikn

00:26:23.325 --> 00:26:28.139
kh'bin nokh aroysgelofn, di goye hot mikh genumen tsu zikh tsu shlofn.

00:26:28.139 --> 00:26:30.831
kh'bin ibergenekhtikt bay di goye

00:26:30.831 --> 00:26:32.211
mit di kinder

00:26:32.211 --> 00:26:37.336
un tsu morgns bin ikh arayn nokh UNK nokh geven a UNK un ikh hob ⟨zi⟩ UNK fartseylt di mayse

00:26:37.341 --> 00:26:39.210
zogn zey "yetst iz shoyn di tsayt

00:26:39.210 --> 00:26:40.582
un muzst antloyfn".

00:26:40.774 --> 00:26:42.998
⟨az m'hot shoyn⟩ kumen zi hargenen

00:26:42.998 --> 00:26:44.480
me muz shoyn antloyfn.

00:26:45.432 --> 00:26:48.767
vayl dos iz geven zeyer nisht keyn zikhere zakh dos

00:26:48.857 --> 00:26:53.356
zitsn aleynt in a shtot a yidish kind iz nisht geven keyn zikhere zakh.

00:26:53.616 --> 00:26:55.534
un azoy iz geven.

00:26:55.336 --> 00:26:57.230
vu zhe zent ir geforn fun dortn?

00:26:56.668 --> 00:27:00.192
zenen mir geforn ⟨say⟩ di di zenen geven mener,

00:27:00.192 --> 00:27:02.081
maystns mener iz gevezn,

00:27:02.357 --> 00:27:05.979
eyn froy ⟨un ikh⟩ dakht zikh mir gevezn dort, aleyn tsu tsvey.

00:27:06.103 --> 00:27:08.139
zaynen geven mener etlekhe.

00:27:08.145 --> 00:27:10.737
geven mayn kuzin, oykhet a kuzin,

00:27:12.651 --> 00:27:16.239
zenen mir geforn nokh SZCZECIN

00:27:17.393 --> 00:27:19.651
me hot genumen a ⟨dos⟩

00:27:19.651 --> 00:27:23.731
un m'iz geforn nokh SZCZECIN, in SZCZECIN

00:27:23.738 --> 00:27:26.134
hot men geshmuglt di grenets

00:27:26.134 --> 00:27:28.035
un me iz arayn nokh BERLIN.

00:27:28.075 --> 00:27:31.106
s'iz geven ⟨BÓG⟩ BOŻE NARODZENIE.

00:27:32.952 --> 00:27:34.999
neyn, s'iz gevezn

00:27:34.999 --> 00:27:37.480
yo, s'iz geven BOŻE NARODZENIE dakht zikh mir.

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:42.109
tsi s'iz gevezn a tog shpeter, tsi s'iz geven ⟨ober⟩ ikh veys nisht.

00:27:42.165 --> 00:27:45.024
oyb azoy iz geven ⟨ober⟩ UNK BOŻE NARODZENIE

00:27:45.024 --> 00:27:48.740
dakht zikh mir, ⟨s'iz shoyn⟩ geven UNK

00:27:47.700 --> 00:27:49.449
ende finef un fertsik

00:27:50.147 --> 00:27:54.221
yo, s'iz shoyn geven dakht zikh mir onfang zeks un fertsik.

00:27:51.874 --> 00:27:54.748
oder onfang zeks un fertsik.

00:27:54.248 --> 00:27:56.284
s'iz shoyn geven UNK

00:27:55.120 --> 00:27:57.296
vu zhe zent ir geven in BERLIN? in SCHLACHTSEE?

00:27:56.560 --> 00:27:58.826
in SCHLACHTENSEE

00:27:58.826 --> 00:28:02.240
yo, ⟨shpet⟩, neyn s'iz nokh nisht geven gemakht di SCHLACHTENSEE.

00:28:01.268 --> 00:28:02.399
ah nokh nisht

00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:03.838
nokh nisht geven geefnt.

00:28:03.838 --> 00:28:06.942
dort me hot ersht geefnt ven ikh bin dort gevezn.

00:28:06.942 --> 00:28:09.280
vayl me ⟨geyt⟩ arayn in a rusishe

00:28:09.280 --> 00:28:11.972
in a rusishe zone.

00:28:09.565 --> 00:28:10.162
zone

00:28:11.972 --> 00:28:15.758
me hot nisht gevust ⟨iz⟩ men arayn in rusishe zone un dort iz gevezn a lager.

00:28:15.865 --> 00:28:18.730
nakher hot men gezogt az di rusn ⟨UNK⟩zukhn undz

00:28:18.730 --> 00:28:22.102
zey viln undz avekshikn UNK ⟨hobn zikh⟩ oysbahaltn

00:28:22.294 --> 00:28:27.151
an a nakht un ⟨nakher⟩ a por tog arumge⟨valgert⟩ zikh

00:28:27.151 --> 00:28:30.146
me hot ⟨undz⟩ arayn epes getrofn bay ⟨daytshke⟩

00:28:30.146 --> 00:28:32.941
un ⟨ikh bin⟩ geven epes a por tog,

00:28:32.941 --> 00:28:36.964
nakher hot men arayn, hot men geefnt epes a ambasade

00:28:36.964 --> 00:28:41.458
dakht zikh mir a, zey hobn gezogt az s'iz geven a molt der

00:28:42.308 --> 00:28:44.293
ambasade fun

00:28:45.615 --> 00:28:47.398
fun

00:28:47.758 --> 00:28:51.248
Poyln, epes a poylishe ambasade dort gevezn.

00:28:51.248 --> 00:28:53.460
hot men dort arayn

00:28:53.460 --> 00:28:55.727
me hot undz gebrengt tsu esn yedn tog

00:28:55.727 --> 00:28:58.305
broyt mitn m- mit RIBA

00:28:58.305 --> 00:29:00.224
mit ⟨kave⟩

00:29:00.224 --> 00:29:03.057
un biz me hot geefnt SCHLACHTENSEE.

00:29:03.057 --> 00:29:05.117
zenen mir arayn nokh SCHLACHTENSEE.

00:29:05.207 --> 00:29:07.428
SCHLACHTENSEE iz shoyn geven gut.

00:29:07.435 --> 00:29:12.755
yeder hot ge- hot er gezogt me vil nisht araynnemen di daytshn zoln do arbetn

00:29:12.755 --> 00:29:16.654
zol yeder zikh ⟨ot⟩ ver es hot a fakh

00:29:16.654 --> 00:29:19.320
zol er geyn ⟨arbetn⟩ zayn fakh

00:29:19.320 --> 00:29:20.777
un

00:29:21.205 --> 00:29:28.067
un zoln, me zol undz darfn, z- zey arayntsunemen, do zoln zey nisht darfn nokh tsu gebn tsu esn.

00:29:28.782 --> 00:29:31.243
s'iz geven, dos iz geven fun di U.N.R.R.A.

00:29:31.243 --> 00:29:32.437
fun di

00:29:32.022 --> 00:29:33.555
J.O.I.N.T. ⟨un⟩ di U.N.R.R.A.

00:29:33.278 --> 00:29:35.259
yo, fun di ⟨U.N.R.R.A.⟩ iz dos gevezn.
